Z||000003||Patrick's Dad||03-28-2000||12:11 AM||||I beat a Fiero GT once. I blew him off at a light. I was in a '96 6 Speed Firebird Formula. I didn't feel very good about myself.... I think that I apologized to my (Fiero) Formula....<P>On the flip side, I kicked a Focus's butt a couple of days ago. He came around me getting off 95N to 93N (South of Boston). The exit runs down to one lane, but as soon as we were on 93, I was doing about 50 in third gear out of the exit, so I just floored it. He tried to chase me,  but he didn't seem to be making it uphill as quickly.... I backed off a bit when I hit 80. The last thing I need is a ticket right now....||||reg||14
